<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Journal Bulk Upload - Diagnostic Flow</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f7f6; margin: 0; padding: 40px; color: #333;">

    <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: white; padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
        
        <h1 style="text-align: center; color: #2c3e50; border-bottom: 2px solid #ecf0f1; padding-bottom: 20px;">Diagnostic Flow: Journal Bulk Upload</h1>
        <p style="text-align: center; color: #7f8c8d; margin-bottom: 40px;">Visualizing the flow from User Action to Database Commit, highlighting Security & Memory Safety layers.</p>

        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: 0.9em;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;"><span style="width: 15px; height: 15px; background-color: #3498db; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 8px;"></span> Frontend (React)</div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;"><span style="width: 15px; height: 15px; background-color: #e67e22; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 8px;"></span> Backend (Java Service)</div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;"><span style="width: 15px; height: 15px; background-color: #9b59b6; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 8px;"></span> Storage (Redis/Disk/DB)</div>
        </div>

        <div style="border: 2px dashed #bdc3c7; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 40px; position: relative;">
            <div style="position: absolute; top: -12px; left: 20px; background: white; padding: 0 10px; color: #7f8c8d; font-weight: bold;">PHASE 1: THE GATEKEEPER (Upload & Init)</div>
            
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <div style="background-color: #3498db; color: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; width: 200px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                    User Selects File
                </div>
                <div style="flex-grow: 1; height: 2px; background-color: #bdc3c7; margin: 0 15px; position: relative;">
                    <span style="position: absolute; top: -20px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); font-size: 0.8em; color: #e74c3c;">Size &lt; 50MB Check</span>
                    <span style="position: absolute; right: 0; top: -4px; border-top: 5px solid transparent; border-bottom: 5px solid transparent; border-left: 8px solid #bdc3c7;"></span>
                </div>
                <div style="background-color: #3498db; color: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; width: 200px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                    POST Request
                    <div style="font-size: 0.8em; font-weight: normal; margin-top: 5px;">MultipartFile</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
                <div style="background-color: #e67e22; color: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; width: 200px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                    Controller
                    <div style="font-size: 0.8em; font-weight: normal; margin-top: 5px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); padding: 2px; border-radius: 4px;">.getInputStream()</div>
                </div>
                <div style="flex-grow: 1; height: 2px; background-color: #bdc3c7; margin: 0 15px; position: relative;">
                    <span style="position: absolute; top: -20px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); font-size: 0.8em; color: #27ae60; font-weight: bold;">STREAMING (No RAM)</span>
                    <span style="position: absolute; right: 0; top: -4px; border-top: 5px solid transparent; border-bottom: 5px solid transparent; border-left: 8px solid #bdc3c7;"></span>
                </div>
                <div style="background-color: #9b59b6; color: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; width: 200px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                    Disk Storage
                    <div style="font-size: 0.8em; font-weight: normal; margin-top: 5px;">Save to Temp File</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="text-align: center; margin: -20px 0 20px 0; color: #bdc3c7; font-size: 24px;">&#8595;</div>

        <div style="border: 2px dashed #bdc3c7; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 40px; position: relative;">
            <div style="position: absolute; top: -12px; left: 20px; background: white; padding: 0 10px; color: #7f8c8d; font-weight: bold;">PHASE 2: ASYNC VALIDATION (Background)</div>

            <div style="display: flex; gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center;">
                <div style="background-color: #e67e22; color: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; width: 180px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                    <div style="font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); padding-bottom: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px;">1. Parse & Clean</div>
                    <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 0.85em;">
                        <li>Read Line-by-Line</li>
                        <li><strong>Remove BOM</strong></li>
                        <li><strong>Trim Spaces</strong></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; color: #7f8c8d;">&#8594;</div>

                <div style="background-color: #e67e22; color: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; width: 180px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                    <div style="font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); padding-bottom: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px;">2. Format Check</div>
                    <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 0.85em;">
                        <li>Regex Check</li>
                        <li>Amount Precision</li>
                        <li><strong>Fail Fast</strong> if error</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; color: #7f8c8d;">&#8594;</div>

                <div style="background-color: #e67e22; color: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; width: 180px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                    <div style="font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); padding-bottom: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px;">3. DB Check</div>
                    <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 0.85em;">
                        <li>Branch Exists?</li>
                        <li>CGL Active?</li>
                        <li>Currency Valid?</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; color: #7f8c8d;">&#8594;</div>

                <div style="background-color: #e67e22; color: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; width: 180px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                    <div style="font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); padding-bottom: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px;">4. Balance Check</div>
                    <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 0.85em;">
                        <li>Sum(Dr) == Sum(Cr)</li>
                        <li>Group by Branch</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top: 20px; border-top: 2px solid #ecf0f1; padding-top: 20px;">
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
                    
                    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: center;">
                        <div style="color: #e74c3c; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">IF ERROR FOUND</div>
                        <div style="background-color: #9b59b6; color: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
                            <div>Generate Error Excel</div>
                            <div style="font-size: 0.8em; margin-top: 5px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); padding: 4px; border-radius: 4px;">
                                🛡️ Sanitize Formulas (CSV Injection)
                            </div>
                            <div style="margin-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); padding-top: 5px;">Save to Redis (Status: ERROR)</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: center;">
                        <div style="color: #27ae60; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">IF SUCCESS</div>
                        <div style="background-color: #9b59b6; color: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
                            <div>Compress Data (GZIP)</div>
                            <div style="font-size: 0.8em; margin-top: 5px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); padding: 4px; border-radius: 4px;">
                                💾 Optimized Memory Storage
                            </div>
                            <div style="margin-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); padding-top: 5px;">Save to Redis (Status: SUCCESS)</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="text-align: center; margin: -20px 0 20px 0; color: #bdc3c7; font-size: 24px;">&#8595;</div>

        <div style="border: 2px dashed #bdc3c7; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; position: relative;">
            <div style="position: absolute; top: -12px; left: 20px; background: white; padding: 0 10px; color: #7f8c8d; font-weight: bold;">PHASE 3: BATCH CREATION (User Submits)</div>
            
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
                <div style="background-color: #3498db; color: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; width: 150px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">
                    User Clicks Submit
                </div>
                <div style="width: 40px; height: 2px; background-color: #bdc3c7; margin: 0 10px;"></div>
                <div style="background-color: #9b59b6; color: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; width: 150px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">
                    Redis Lock
                    <div style="font-size: 0.8em; font-weight: normal;">Prevent Duplicates</div>
                </div>
                <div style="width: 40px; height: 2px; background-color: #bdc3c7; margin: 0 10px;"></div>
                <div style="background-color: #e67e22; color: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; width: 150px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">
                    Async Insert
                    <div style="font-size: 0.8em; font-weight: normal;">Parallel Threads</div>
                </div>
                <div style="width: 40px; height: 2px; background-color: #bdc3c7; margin: 0 10px;"></div>
                <div style="background-color: #9b59b6; color: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; width: 150px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">
                    Database
                    <div style="font-size: 0.8em; font-weight: normal;">Commit Batch</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
